From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] uiribbon: framework object model, ribbon view and image factory (3579)

uiribbon: framework object model, ribbon view and image factory

IUIFramework Initialize/Destroy/LoadUI/GetView/Get- and SetUICommandProperty/InvalidateUICommand/
FlushPendingInvalidations/SetModes work: LoadUI finds the UIRIBBON resource and gives the application
an IUIRibbon view (OnViewChanged CREATE, DESTROY on Destroy); invalidations ask the command's handler
for a new property value, from the message loop or on flush. The ribbon markup itself is not
interpreted. UIRibbonImageFromBitmapFactory and IUIImage are new. LockServer no longer logs a FIXME.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS
